---
title: a11yTrack - issue status workflow
config:
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Arial
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Open : issue created
  Open --> InProgress : start work
  InProgress --> Fixed : fix applied
  Fixed --> Verified : fix confirmed
  Verified --> Closed : close
  Fixed --> Reopened : fix did not hold
  Verified --> Reopened : regression found
  Reopened --> InProgress : start work again
  Closed --> [*]

  state "In Progress" as InProgress

  note right of Closed
    Closed is final. A regression on a
    closed issue is a new issue that
    links to the old one.

    Blocked example: Open to Closed.
    Nothing closes without Fixed and
    Verified. The backend rejects any
    transition not in ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS
    with HTTP 400.
  end note
